      "rationale": "Develops effective leadership, emotional intelligence, leadership development, positive change, and appreciative inquiry skills, building on the previous courses and promoting a growth mindset."
    },
    {
      "step": 12,
      "course_id": "COU543",
      "rationale": "Covers storytelling, leadership style, strategic planning, engagement, and expense control, integrating the previous courses' concepts and applying them to real-world scenarios."
    },
    {
      "step": 13,
