      "course_id": "COU5239",
      "rationale": "Covers project management, change management, strategic thinking, career development, and organizational culture, integrating the previous courses' concepts and applying them to real-world scenarios."
    },
    {
      "step": 16,
      "course_id": "COU1649",
      "rationale": "Develops training and development, setting objectives, leadership style, strategic planning, and communication skills, building on the previous courses and promoting a growth mindset."
    },
